---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="About">
  <section class="shell section">
    <div class="page-intro">
      <p class="eyebrow">ABOUT THE ENGINEER</p>
      <h1>
        Curiosity in the details.
        <br />
        <span class="blue">Clarity in the system.</span>
      </h1>
    </div>
    <div class="about-grid">
      <div class="prose">
        <h2>I’m Erick Murakami.</h2>
        <p>
          I’m a back-end software engineer focused on Java, Spring Boot, and
          Quarkus. My interests include API design, distributed systems, and the
          architectural trade-offs that keep software maintainable.
        </p>
        <p>
          I use personal projects to explore concrete engineering questions: how
          to preserve tenant boundaries, enforce request limits, coordinate
          events with transactions, and model financial workflows.
        </p>
        <p>
          This portfolio presents those implementations alongside their
          limitations. Every case study links to the source so you can inspect
          the details.
        </p>
        <a class="button primary" href="/contact/">
          Let’s connect ↗
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class="project-card">
        <p class="eyebrow">PRIMARY TOOLKIT</p>
        <h3>The Java ecosystem.</h3>
        <dl class="toolkit">
          <dt>Backend</dt>
          <dd>Java · Quarkus · Spring Boot</dd>
          <dt>Data</dt>
          <dd>PostgreSQL · Hibernate · Redis</dd>
          <dt>Integration</dt>
          <dd>REST APIs · RabbitMQ</dd>
          <dt>Delivery</dt>
          <dd>Docker · Git · GitHub Actions</dd>
        </dl>
        <a
          class="text-link"
          href="https://github.com/ErickMurakami/ErickMurakami"
        >
          Read my GitHub profile ↗
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
